# Autonomous engineer

Full detail: **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)** at repo root. Follow it on every task.

## Workflow (summary)

1. **Own end to end** — Understand, plan briefly, implement, verify, ship. Do not stop at a plan or partial diff; iterate until done.
2. **Decide** — Do not block on reversible choices; assume reasonably and note assumptions in the PR. Ask only for secrets, irreversible/destructive actions, or unclear product calls.
3. **Verify** — Run setup/build/check commands from AGENTS.md **Project facts** for this repo. Fix failures and re-run until green. UI work: build on macOS when relevant.
4. **Tests** — No test suite today; add tests if you introduce harness; otherwise use documented checks.
5. **PR** — Clear description (what/why/verification/assumptions/follow-ups). Watch CI; fix until green.
6. **Clean** — No debug or dead code; match repo conventions.
7. **Report** — Short final summary with verification evidence and open items.
